    <bpmn:process id="W_W1693" name="W1693. Asset Transfer Between Locations" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Business need to relocate asset (store closure, new store needs equipment, DC rebalancing, departmental reorganization)
Frequency: ~50–100 transfers/month
Volume: ~600–1,200 transfers/year
Owner: Fixed Asset Accountant
Participants: Fixed Asset Accountant, Sending Location Manager, Receiving Location Manager, Logistics
Source: workflow W1693 — Asset Transfer Between Locations</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W1693_LaneSet6">
        <bpmn:lane id="W1693_Lane1" name="Sending Location Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1693_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1693_Start7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1693_Lane2" name="Fixed Asset Accountant">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1693_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1693_Lane3" name="Logistics">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1693_Task10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1693_Lane4" name="Receiving Location Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1693_Task11</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1693_Lane5" name="System">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1693_Task12</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1693_End13</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W1693_Start7" name="Business need to relocate asset (store closure, new store needs equipment, DC…">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1693_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1693_Task8" name="Sending location initiates asset transfer request in system: (a) selects…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Sending location initiates asset transfer request in system: (a) selects asset(s) to transfer, (b) specifies destination location and reason, (c) for inter-entity transfers (e.g., Depot Inc. → Logistics Inc.): triggers intercompany transfer pricing review, (d) the sending location&#x27;s custodian of record releases the asset from custody in the same action — custody is in transit, never unassigned, until the receiving scan
Responsible (R): Sending Location Manager
Accountable (A): Fixed Asset Accountant
Duration: 10 min/request</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1693_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1693_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1693_Task9" name="Fixed Asset Accountant reviews transfer request: (a) verifies asset exists and…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Fixed Asset Accountant reviews transfer request: (a) verifies asset exists and is active at sending location, (b) confirms asset is not pledged as collateral or subject to legal hold, (c) for inter-entity: ensures arm&#x27;s-length valuation (book value or fair value per transfer pricing policy), (d) approves or rejects transfer
Responsible (R): Fixed Asset Accountant
Accountable (A): Accounting Manager
Duration: 10 min/request</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1693_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1693_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1693_Task10" name="System generates asset transfer order; logistics arranges physical movement if…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: System generates asset transfer order; logistics arranges physical movement if needed (forklifts, large fixtures); sending location prepares asset for transport
Responsible (R): Logistics / Sending Location
Accountable (A): —
Duration: Variable</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1693_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1693_Flow19</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1693_Task11" name="Receiving location scans asset tag upon arrival; confirms asset identity and…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Receiving location scans asset tag upon arrival; confirms asset identity and condition — the scan is the receiving custodian&#x27;s custody acceptance, completing the release-to-accept chain opened in step 1; system updates: (a) asset location code changed to receiving location, (b) cost center reassigned, (c) physical inventory record updated, (d) depreciation continues without interruption (same useful life and method)
Responsible (R): Receiving Location Manager
Accountable (A): Fixed Asset Accountant
Duration: 5 min/asset</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1693_Flow19</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1693_Flow20</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W1693_Task12" name="For inter-entity transfers: system generates intercompany journal entry — asset…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: For inter-entity transfers: system generates intercompany journal entry — asset removed from sending entity&#x27;s register, added to receiving entity&#x27;s register; any gain/loss on transfer recognized in sending entity if transfer price ≠ book value
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): Fixed Asset Accountant
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1693_Flow20</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1693_Flow21</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W1693_End13" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W1693_Flow21</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W1693_Annotation14">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-346 (ensure controlled execution — Asset Registration &amp; Lifecycle Tracking (PA-35.1).) | - operational: Fixed Asset Accountant review and approval gate
Owner: Fixed Asset Accountant</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W1693_Assoc15" sourceRef="W1693_Annotation14" targetRef="W1693_Start7" associationDirection="None" />
